WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.555
Quick question.

00:00:01.825 --> 00:00:04.850
Do you know which jobs actually made you money last month?

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:07.108
Not your revenue. Your profit.

00:00:07.378 --> 00:00:10.669
If you had to stop and think about it, this video is for you.

00:00:10.939 --> 00:00:15.527
In the next few minutes, I'll show you how to see the real numbers behind your business,

00:00:15.797 --> 00:00:19.244
in one Excel workbook, built for your exact industry.

00:00:20.144 --> 00:00:21.926
Here's what usually happens.

00:00:22.196 --> 00:00:25.705
Jobs get done. Invoices go out. Money comes in.

00:00:25.975 --> 00:00:28.082
And it feels like things are going fine.

00:00:28.352 --> 00:00:30.075
But your numbers live everywhere.

00:00:30.345 --> 00:00:33.289
Spreadsheets. Receipts. Bank apps. Your head.

00:00:33.559 --> 00:00:35.069
So you can see revenue…

00:00:35.339 --> 00:00:37.955
but not margin by job or by client.

00:00:38.225 --> 00:00:40.212
Not where costs are quietly growing.

00:00:40.482 --> 00:00:42.338
Not how cash is really moving.

00:00:42.608 --> 00:00:44.847
And not what deserves your attention next.

00:00:45.117 --> 00:00:46.812
Then tax season shows up,

00:00:47.082 --> 00:00:50.658
and meeting your accountant means a week of digging for receipts.

00:00:51.558 --> 00:00:55.062
You don't need more software. You don't need another subscription.

00:00:55.332 --> 00:00:59.669
You need your own numbers, organized the way your business actually works.

00:01:00.569 --> 00:01:03.185
That's exactly what ProfitIQS builds.

00:01:03.455 --> 00:01:06.206
Business Intelligence Systems™, made in Excel,

00:01:06.476 --> 00:01:08.610
for 21 different kinds of business.

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:13.095
63 systems in total. Three editions for every industry.

00:01:13.365 --> 00:01:14.978
Let me show you a real one.

00:01:15.878 --> 00:01:18.367
We'll walk through the workbook, the deeper tools,

00:01:18.637 --> 00:01:22.304
the questions owners usually ask, and how to pick your edition.

00:01:23.204 --> 00:01:28.082
This is the Auto Repair Shop system. Everything you see is sample data.

00:01:28.352 --> 00:01:29.742
Step one: Setup.

00:01:30.012 --> 00:01:32.877
Enter your business name, your name, and your country.

00:01:33.147 --> 00:01:37.212
That sets your currency and tax reserve rate for the whole system.

00:01:38.112 --> 00:01:39.779
Step two: enter your work.

00:01:40.049 --> 00:01:42.139
Every repair order gets one line:

00:01:42.409 --> 00:01:46.250
parts revenue, parts cost, labor revenue, labor cost.

00:01:46.520 --> 00:01:49.199
And the profit on that job calculates itself.

00:01:49.469 --> 00:01:52.201
Expenses go in the same way, by category.

00:01:53.101 --> 00:01:55.160
Step three: open the Dashboard.

00:01:55.430 --> 00:01:59.698
Total revenue. Total expenses. Net profit. Net margin.

00:01:59.968 --> 00:02:02.118
Your average profit per repair order,

00:02:02.388 --> 00:02:04.674
and how much you should set aside for tax.

00:02:04.944 --> 00:02:07.821
Month by month, revenue against expenses.

00:02:08.091 --> 00:02:11.788
And below that, it tells you in plain words what the numbers mean.

00:02:12.688 --> 00:02:15.428
The Business Health Snapshot scores five areas:

00:02:15.698 --> 00:02:19.768
profit, cash, tax readiness, expenses, and revenue trend.

00:02:20.038 --> 00:02:24.487
And when your accountant asks for numbers, there's an export ready to hand over.

00:02:24.757 --> 00:02:26.396
That's the Essential edition.

00:02:27.296 --> 00:02:31.324
Elite goes much deeper. In auto repair, that's dozens of sheets.

00:02:31.594 --> 00:02:35.727
An Executive Command Center: your last twelve months on one screen.

00:02:35.997 --> 00:02:40.463
Technician performance: productivity and efficiency for every tech.

00:02:40.733 --> 00:02:44.324
A comeback tracker, so repeat repairs don't stay invisible.

00:02:44.594 --> 00:02:49.383
Cash flow, receivables, and a six-month forecast in three scenarios.

00:02:50.283 --> 00:02:52.759
And then there's the Profit Leak Detector™.

00:02:53.029 --> 00:02:58.882
It flags low-margin jobs, warranty losses, inventory waste, and collection problems

00:02:59.152 --> 00:03:02.136
with a simple traffic light: healthy, or review.

00:03:02.406 --> 00:03:05.920
It all rolls up into one Business Health Score™, out of 100.

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:09.328
So instead of guessing where to look, you know where to start.

00:03:10.228 --> 00:03:12.218
