00:03:32.372 --> 00:03:37.226
Built around the numbers your business actually watches. Not a generic template.

00:03:38.126 --> 00:03:42.807
Auto repair, HVAC, plumbing, electrical, roofing, construction.

00:03:43.077 --> 00:03:46.371
